    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get that it's a caution thing but i really dont have the money for an urgent care visit right now. its just a tiny cut. if i take some extra strength ibuprofen to help with the shivering and just keep it clean, is there any way i can tell if it's getting better or worse at home? like what's a safe way to just manage this until monday without going in?",
